# Project-specific output and agent-install artifacts only. Python
# caches, venvs, packaging, editor, and agent-discovery noise (including
# graphify-out/) is covered by the host global ignore (gitignore_global,
# swept 2026-10-22).

# Local run databases and per-app run dirs.
*.db
.hyperresearch/
bench/
codex_bench/
draco-bench/

# Env files. Belt-and-braces with the global ignore block.
.env

# Agent install outputs — generated per-user by `hyperresearch install`.
# These files contain absolute paths resolved to the installing user's
# Python environment. NEVER commit them. The authoritative versions live
# in src/hyperresearch/skills/ (skills) and src/hyperresearch/core/hooks.py
# (agent templates).
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md

# Per-vault research output. Never commit: this is run data, not source.
output/
research/

# tmux session pane logs + per-lane status files. Not source.
orchestrator/logs/

.knack/
SOUL.md

# Serena language-server index. Machine-local.
.serena/
